<Base title="Two apps, composed" description="A live Photo Guestbook and Curated Showcase sharing real approved contributions through independent source apps."><h1>A moment becomes a feature.</h1><p class="lede">Two independently deployed apps share a useful workflow through a versioned item contract. The same source runs here and on each standalone site.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/guestbook">Open the guestbook</a><a class="button secondary" href="/showcase">Open the showcase</a></div><div class="split section"><div><img src="/brand/courtyard-ai-v1.jpg" alt="Generated fictional courtyard with terracotta walls and a green chair" width="1200" height="630"/><h2>Here / there</h2><p>A real photo submission waits privately for owner review. Approval makes it eligible; hiding or deletion revokes its public media.</p><a href="https://guestbook.loftwah.com">Standalone guestbook</a> · <a href="https://github.com/loftwah/app-composer-guestbook">Independent source</a></div><div><img src="/brand/coastal-path-ai-v1.jpg" alt="Generated fictional coastal steps beside a calm sea" width="1200" height="800"/><h2>Top shelf</h2><p>Curate your own links or select an approved contribution. Cards open their original item and check its visibility on each request.</p><a href="https://showcase.loftwah.com">Standalone showcase</a> · <a href="https://github.com/loftwah/app-composer-showcase">Independent source</a></div></div><section class="section"><h2>Try the public view. Owner writes stay protected.</h2><p>The gallery uses labelled original demo artwork. Uploading, moderation, configuration and curation require an invited owner credential. This first release is operated by an authorised agent; it does not offer anonymous builds or store visitors’ Cloudflare credentials.</p><ol><li>Submit a supported photo to the guestbook.</li><li>Approve the contribution in the owner studio.</li><li>Select it in Showcase and feature it.</li><li>Open the card into the original contribution.</li><li>Hide or delete the source: the feature and controlled image disappear.</li></ol><a href="/release">See what has actually been verified</a></section></Base>
